      "description": "Round 9 (2026-10-29), owner feedback item 6. University news office article by David Tenenbaum on the Muir Knoll plaque; news.wisc.edu is not in the registry (only UW-Madison Libraries hosts are), so secondary. Found as https://news.wisc.edu/?p=18547, which redirects to this canonical url. Second holder for Muir's dormitory room in North Hall, after the Sierra Club vault (MUI-S-0024, browser snapshot) became unreachable to the adversary's live check (Error 15)."
