        {
          "ihh:source": {
            "@id": "ihh:MUI-S-0005"
          },
          "ihh:quote": "In 1871, Transcendentalist-thinker Ralph Waldo Emerson saw Yosemite, which reminded the New Englander of White Mountain Notch.",
