          "ihh:source": {
            "@id": "ihh:MUI-S-0024"
          },
          "ihh:quote": "1849\nApril 21 : John Muir turns 11 years old\nFebruary : The Muir family emigrates from Glasgow to New York, the trip taking six weeks by sailing ship, then via the Great Lakes and wagon to Fountain Lake , Buffalo Township, Marquette County, Wisconsin.",
