      "ihh:notes": "Round 9 (owner feedback item 6, 2026-10-29): corroborates MUI-F-0113 (single-source, Sierra Club only) with a second holder, the Wisconsin Historical Society property record for North Hall (HI100645). Worded with the words both holders share; no year is claimed (the WHS record says 1861 to 1863; the Sierra Club places it in its 1861 entry). The 1975 NHL nomination for North Hall (NPS 66000021) was read and does not name Muir. Place repaired before adversary review (2026-10-29): was 'North Hall, University of Wisconsin, Madison', which G2 flagged (a name not in the evidence)."
